{"content_hash": "5829d93024e62b9b", "version_id": 792, "article_id": 80, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Rokid launches two AI glasses and a smart ring", "title_zh": "Rokid发布两款AI眼镜和一枚智能戒指", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8183616.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5b/COP30_-_Rokid_01.jpg", "provider": "openverse", "credit": "Xuthoria · by-sa 4.0 · via wikimedia", "author": "Xuthoria", "credit_url": "", "source": "Openverse", "source_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=179047007", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(155, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(193, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "f54bcf2dfbf0"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-28", "word_count": 126, "reading_minutes": 0.6, "lead": "On October 27, 2026, the Chinese company Rokid showed three new products. They are two pairs of AI glasses and a smart ring. The glasses can translate speech and help at work.", "lead_zh": "2026年10月27日，中国公司Rokid发布了三款新产品：两副AI眼镜和一枚智能戒指。这些眼镜可以翻译对话，还能在工作中帮忙。", "preview": "Rokid Glasses 2 costs 3,699 yuan. With a government discount, buyers pay 3,199 yuan. The full-color Rokid Color starts at 4,999 yuan. The Ro", "preview_zh": "Rokid Glasses 2售价3699元，享受国家补贴后到手价3199元。全彩款Rokid Color起售价4999元，Rokid Ring售价1699元。三款产品在发布会后开售。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 775, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/80/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 52.825, "size_bytes": 317952, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 145, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/80/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 53.825, "size_bytes": 323856, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 145, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/80/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/80/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 57.775, "size_bytes": 347616, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 145, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/80/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/80/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 50.65, "size_bytes": 304848, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 145, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/80/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/80/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 53.0, "size_bytes": 318960, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 145, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/80/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@220942b/content/data/versions/792.json", "paragraphs": ["Rokid Glasses 2 costs 3,699 yuan. With a government discount, buyers pay 3,199 yuan. The full-color Rokid Color starts at 4,999 yuan. The Rokid Ring costs 1,699 yuan. All three products go on sale after the event.", "The new glasses are lighter and smaller than the old ones. They have better sound and a bigger battery. The battery is 25% larger. Users can also add their own prescription lenses. The glasses support AI meeting notes and calls in 89 languages.", "Rokid Color has a full-color screen. People can see pictures, maps and videos on it. The Rokid Ring lets users touch and swipe to control the glasses. It also checks heart rate, temperature and sleep. Rokid says more than 45,000 developers now work on its platform."], "paragraphs_zh": ["Rokid Glasses 2售价3699元，享受国家补贴后到手价3199元。全彩款Rokid Color起售价4999元，Rokid Ring售价1699元。三款产品在发布会后开售。", "新眼镜比上一代更轻更小，音质更好，电池也更大，容量增加了25%。用户还可以加装自己的近视镜片。眼镜支持AI会议纪要和89种语言的通话翻译。", "Rokid Color配有全彩屏幕，用户可以在上面看图片、地图和视频。Rokid Ring让用户通过触摸和滑动来控制眼镜，还能监测心率、体温和睡眠。Rokid表示，其平台开发者已超过4.5万名。"], "body": "Rokid Glasses 2 costs 3,699 yuan. With a government discount, buyers pay 3,199 yuan. The full-color Rokid Color starts at 4,999 yuan. The Rokid Ring costs 1,699 yuan. All three products go on sale after the event.\n\nThe new glasses are lighter and smaller than the old ones. They have better sound and a bigger battery. The battery is 25% larger. Users can also add their own prescription lenses. The glasses support AI meeting notes and calls in 89 languages.\n\nRokid Color has a full-color screen. People can see pictures, maps and videos on it. The Rokid Ring lets users touch and swipe to control the glasses. It also checks heart rate, temperature and sleep. Rokid says more than 45,000 developers now work on its platform.", "body_zh": "Rokid Glasses 2售价3699元，享受国家补贴后到手价3199元。全彩款Rokid Color起售价4999元，Rokid Ring售价1699元。三款产品在发布会后开售。\n\n新眼镜比上一代更轻更小，音质更好，电池也更大，容量增加了25%。用户还可以加装自己的近视镜片。眼镜支持AI会议纪要和89种语言的通话翻译。\n\nRokid Color配有全彩屏幕，用户可以在上面看图片、地图和视频。Rokid Ring让用户通过触摸和滑动来控制眼镜，还能监测心率、体温和睡眠。Rokid表示，其平台开发者已超过4.5万名。", "text": "Rokid Glasses 2 costs 3,699 yuan. With a government discount, buyers pay 3,199 yuan. The full-color Rokid Color starts at 4,999 yuan. The Rokid Ring costs 1,699 yuan. All three products go on sale after the event. The new glasses are lighter and smaller than the old ones. They have better sound and a bigger battery. The battery is 25% larger. Users can also add their own prescription lenses. The glasses support AI meeting notes and calls in 89 languages. Rokid Color has a full-color screen. People can see pictures, maps and videos on it. The Rokid Ring lets users touch and swipe to control the glasses. It also checks heart rate, temperature and sleep. Rokid says more than 45,000 developers now work on its platform.", "vocab": [{"word": "launch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布；推出", "note": "常用来说新产品上市", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "glasse